    fix(show): remove duplicate evidence trail from --evidence (README-5)
    
    The _cmd_show function was re-attaching the runbook's own evidence_trail
    back into the runbook via attach_evidence, doubling every entry (3->6).
    
    The compiled runbook already carries its trail; --evidence just renders
    it.  Skip the pointless re-attach.
    
    Also remove the now-unused attach_evidence import.
    
    Addresses README-5.
    ch:trace row=README-5 commit=<auto> test=tests/test_cli_surface.py::test_cli_show_evidence_json evidence=show gateway-drain-window --evidence --format json (3 entries, not 6)
